<title>UK: Mediocredito Centrale set 300 bln lire 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Mediocredito Centrale set 300 bln lire 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEDIOCREDITO CENTRALE SPA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *6.0	 MATURITY    20.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/A+</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST YEAR THEN PAYS SIX MONTH BOT PLUS 40 BP AT</p>
<p>		ISSUERS OPTION.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
